                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There is no doubt that what is presented here is absolute mad genius.  If the developers weren't so completely whacked out, I've no doubt that this would be one of the top selling (and best) games on the Vive.  However, what is presented here is fine as-is and serves as a slight, abliet infuriating, testament to their brilliance.  Seriously guys, you need to focus your talent and develop this into a full-fledged platformer; you are sitting on gold here!\n\n",
